     H*A NAME CONTINUED WITH ... STANDS ALONE ON ITS LINE; THE DEFINITION
     H*ENTRIES GO ON THE LINE THAT COMPLETES IT. IBM I REJECTS ENTRIES NEXT TO
     H*THE CONTINUED PART (RNF0622).
     HDFTACTGRP(*NO)
     DcustomerNumb...  S
     Der               S             10I 0
     C                   EVAL      customerNumber = 1
     C                   RETURN
